{
  "name": "Posts",
  "description": "The shop's blog: one row per post, shown at its Path (/blog/<slug>), listed newest Published at first on /blog, in the sitemap, the RSS feed (/blog/rss.xml) and /llms.txt. Only rows whose Status is Published are on the site; a Draft or In review row is a 404 and in no list. Body is simple Markdown (# headings, - lists, **bold**, [links](/products/<product-id>), tables); a link to a product on sale also shows that product under the post. Legacy paths (a JSON list such as [\"/blog/old-address\"]) redirect to the current Path. An Agent writes drafts only, with facts from this shop's tables; the owner reads the draft and sets Status to Published. A change shows on the website within about a minute. The fields follow busabase-cms-sdk's standard Posts, so that SDK can read this table by its slug.",
  "position": 5,
